    "# Supplementary Figure S7 — QC / batch diagnostics on the integrated UMAP\n",
    "\n",
    "Mouse cortex, 1,577 QC-passed cells. Panels A–F on the joint (three-modality)\n",
    "embedding: biological replicate before and after Harmony, library-prep batch,\n",
    "and four per-cell QC measures.\n",
    "\n",
    "| § | What it does |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| §1 | setup — paths and libraries |\n",
    "| §2 | shared helpers |\n",
    "| §3 | the **uncorrected** (pre-Harmony) joint embedding — the \"before correction\" half of panel A |\n",
    "| §4 | draws panels A–F and writes `joint_umap_qc_panels.{pdf,png}` |\n",
    "\n",
    "§3 and §4 read the embeddings, layouts and annotation from\n",
    "`subset_clustering/250kb_denovo/{tables,annotation}/`, which\n",
    "`main_figures/fig3/fig3_umap.ipynb` writes. That is what lets this notebook run\n",
    "on its own, without the embedding chain that precedes these panels in the Fig-3\n",
    "notebook (where they appear as §8.7c).\n"
   ]
